	(text "Datasheet Page 18:\nVDD5 supply must be powered up before the VCC33 supply [...]\nIf it is not possible to power up VDD5 before VCC33,\nthen the ENn_CC pin must be held high while both supplies are ramping\nand then asserted low after both supplies are stable [...]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.018 152.908 0)
