		(uuid "d5ed5204-dae4-4075-b743-26300b349842")
	)
	(text "To keep the BOM small, I am using 887k as a shield resistor (and not 1M)\nsince the HD3SS3220 wants 880-910k on VBUS_DET and I dont want to risk using a 1M there"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
